WEBVTT

01:20.950 --> 01:26.610
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.539 --> 01:29.760
[Episode 18]

01:29.980 --> 01:33.870
[Baoxiang Temple]

01:43.700 --> 01:47.570
[Baoxiang Temple]

01:54.789 --> 01:56.200
Why are you standing here?

01:56.200 --> 01:57.130
Aren't you cold?

01:57.780 --> 02:01.170
[Hall of the Great Hero]

01:58.150 --> 01:59.070
Third Master.

02:02.070 --> 02:03.630
I want to stay here

02:03.680 --> 02:04.760
to clear my head.

02:07.120 --> 02:08.080
Why is that?

02:10.300 --> 02:12.360
I need to make myself firmly remember

02:12.560 --> 02:14.310
that the person standing in front of me

02:14.310 --> 02:15.570
is no ordinary person,

02:16.190 --> 02:18.120
but a Grand Secretary of the Court.

02:19.800 --> 02:20.630
I see.

02:21.870 --> 02:23.150
You're hinting at me,

02:23.680 --> 02:25.140
telling me to clear my head

02:25.630 --> 02:26.310
and

02:27.430 --> 02:29.360
not put on airs with you from now on.

02:30.560 --> 02:31.680
I wouldn't dare.

02:32.750 --> 02:34.350
I promise that in the future,

02:34.640 --> 02:35.660
I'll arrive before you do.

02:35.660 --> 02:37.060
I won't keep you waiting.

02:38.680 --> 02:40.190
I never said that.

02:41.230 --> 02:42.190
I understand.

02:46.520 --> 02:47.840
Seeing him today,

02:47.870 --> 02:49.670
he seems different from before.

02:51.850 --> 02:56.430
[Hall of the Great Hero]

02:52.840 --> 02:54.750
The people connected to Prince Ruichang

02:54.750 --> 02:56.880
are far more numerous than we thought.

02:57.030 --> 03:00.090
Many of them held positions
in the Ministry of Revenue.

03:00.680 --> 03:02.480
They have all been replaced now.

03:02.910 --> 03:04.310
As a result, the Ministry of Revenue

03:04.310 --> 03:05.840
is severely understaffed.

03:07.000 --> 03:09.280
Although your father's personal morals
are flawed,

03:09.280 --> 03:10.000
he has

03:11.030 --> 03:13.030
nothing to do with Prince Ruichang.

03:13.680 --> 03:16.960
He also has no close ties
with other high-ranking officials.

03:16.960 --> 03:17.840
So,

03:18.520 --> 03:19.850
after thinking it over,

03:20.560 --> 03:21.520
I still

03:22.000 --> 03:23.190
plan to keep him.

03:25.470 --> 03:26.470
What do you think?

03:28.190 --> 03:29.630
This is a matter of state.

03:29.910 --> 03:31.240
You don't need to ask me.

03:32.079 --> 03:32.710
But

03:32.840 --> 03:34.440
he is your father, after all.

03:40.750 --> 03:41.280
Oh right,

03:42.000 --> 03:44.660
there is something I've been wanting
to ask you.

03:45.150 --> 03:46.150
Why did you help

03:46.590 --> 03:47.710
Ye Xian so much?

03:48.800 --> 03:49.800
You mean

03:50.079 --> 03:51.810
delivering that letter to him?

03:54.400 --> 03:55.120
Didn't

03:55.120 --> 03:57.360
you give me the message on purpose

03:57.800 --> 03:59.310
so I could warn him?

04:00.520 --> 04:02.120
Even though I intentionally

04:02.430 --> 04:03.760
asked you to deliver it,

04:04.430 --> 04:06.280
you still had to agree to do it.

04:07.280 --> 04:08.000
You knew perfectly well

04:08.000 --> 04:09.840
that this matter was very dangerous.

04:09.840 --> 04:10.750
You were kidnapped

04:10.750 --> 04:12.210
and almost lost your life,

04:12.240 --> 04:14.300
but you still helped him recklessly.

04:15.030 --> 04:15.630
Why?

04:16.750 --> 04:17.720
Because...

04:20.160 --> 04:22.040
He also took many risks to save me.

04:22.270 --> 04:23.120
To me,

04:23.310 --> 04:24.600
he is a true friend.

04:27.240 --> 04:28.070
Just a friend?

04:52.870 --> 04:53.670
What about me?

04:57.950 --> 04:58.830
If I ever encountered

04:58.830 --> 05:00.430
such a dangerous situation,

05:01.310 --> 05:02.510
would you help me too?

05:04.480 --> 05:05.160
I would.

05:06.270 --> 05:07.680
So I am also your friend?

05:12.560 --> 05:13.190
Yes.

05:15.430 --> 05:17.270
Ever since I was appointed to the cabinet,

05:17.270 --> 05:19.360
matchmakers have been visiting frequently.

05:19.360 --> 05:20.680
Old Madam and my mentor

05:20.950 --> 05:22.350
are also pushing me hard.

05:24.560 --> 05:25.560
You are so young

05:25.560 --> 05:27.290
and already a Grand Secretary.

05:27.950 --> 05:28.560
In the capital,

05:28.560 --> 05:30.390
any family with a daughter to marry

05:30.390 --> 05:32.790
would naturally want an alliance with you.

05:33.159 --> 05:33.760
Is that so?

05:39.310 --> 05:40.170
What about you?

05:43.159 --> 05:43.870
Me?

06:00.920 --> 06:01.720
I don't want

06:01.830 --> 06:03.090
to be just your friend.

06:04.480 --> 06:05.880
Don't move. Listen to me.

06:06.800 --> 06:08.860
We've been through so much together.

06:09.120 --> 06:09.980
Are you willing

06:10.510 --> 06:11.600
to marry me?

06:12.870 --> 06:18.490
♪ In the bustling crowd,
every step foreshadows this meeting ♪

06:19.930 --> 06:22.300
♪ Smiling, you remark
that no beautiful scenery in the world ♪

06:23.730 --> 06:27.450
♪ Can match this destined encounter ♪

06:28.540 --> 06:33.780
♪ Time passes quietly,
and this meeting feels like fate ♪Tranquil time, like a kind of connection ♪

06:35.500 --> 06:37.760
♪ A lifetime spent answering this riddle ♪

06:38.740 --> 06:43.310
♪ If a story's beginning
requires courage ♪

06:44.510 --> 06:47.330
♪ I'm willing to take the brush first ♪

06:48.540 --> 06:51.170
♪ With a true heart, paint a scene of us
together through days and nights ♪

06:52.350 --> 06:55.150
♪ I'll always stand here,
quietly guarding ♪

06:55.920 --> 06:57.070
Are you kidding me?

06:56.220 --> 06:58.909
♪ That very moment
of our first encounter ♪

06:57.310 --> 06:58.390
I never thought

06:58.830 --> 06:59.950
you would say this to me.

06:59.880 --> 07:02.230
♪ Whether it is fate or divine will ♪

07:00.720 --> 07:01.430
If I had known

07:01.430 --> 07:02.800
you were going to tell me this,

07:02.800 --> 07:04.000
I wouldn't have come today.

07:03.630 --> 07:06.110
♪ There is no need to analyze it anymore ♪

07:04.920 --> 07:05.630
I never thought

07:05.630 --> 07:07.030
about us being together.

07:07.600 --> 07:10.690
♪ When you look back, the wind rises ♪

07:08.120 --> 07:09.680
If you never thought about it,

07:09.680 --> 07:11.620
then start thinking about it from today.

07:11.620 --> 07:14.530
♪ Gently stirring heartbeats and breaths ♪

07:15.010 --> 07:18.100
♪ Only your palm remains warm as before ♪

07:17.510 --> 07:18.270
No need.

07:18.950 --> 07:21.680
♪ Warming my wandering, lonely soul ♪

07:19.130 --> 07:20.630
I have already made up my mind.

07:20.630 --> 07:22.560
I won't marry in this lifetime.

07:22.810 --> 07:26.050
♪ Everything exists because of you ♪

07:22.950 --> 07:25.440
I'll go to Shanxi to do business
in the future.

07:25.440 --> 07:26.510
By then, you should also find

07:26.510 --> 07:27.040
a woman

07:26.870 --> 07:29.860
♪ Every step together brings joy ♪

07:27.040 --> 07:28.870
who is a suitable match for your status.

07:28.870 --> 07:30.400
I have matters to attend to.

07:30.580 --> 07:33.340
♪ Day by day, side by side ♪

07:30.800 --> 07:31.930
I must go back first.

07:34.350 --> 07:36.830
♪ Whether it is fate or divine will ♪

07:38.100 --> 07:40.650
♪ There is no need to analyze it anymore ♪

07:42.070 --> 07:45.450
♪ When you look back, the wind rises ♪

07:46.490 --> 07:49.240
♪ Gently stirring heartbeats and breaths ♪Blow away your heartbeat and breath

07:50.240 --> 07:54.560
♪ Year after year, side by side ♪

07:58.630 --> 07:59.830
So...

08:00.360 --> 08:02.020
Third Master proposed to you?

08:03.500 --> 08:08.970
[Pavilion of Fragrant Incense]

08:04.270 --> 08:05.800
And you rejected him?

08:07.480 --> 08:09.040
Are you foolish, My Lady?

08:09.310 --> 08:10.430
That's Third Master,

08:10.430 --> 08:11.630
the Grand Secretary.

08:12.950 --> 08:13.830
So what?

08:14.560 --> 08:16.040
The more powerful a man is,

08:16.120 --> 08:18.180
the more wives and concubines he has.

08:18.870 --> 08:20.480
The Chen family is a large
established household.

08:20.480 --> 08:21.610
If I married into it,

08:21.750 --> 08:22.630
I wouldn't be able to control it

08:22.630 --> 08:23.480
or stop it.

08:24.720 --> 08:25.510
Besides,

08:26.040 --> 08:27.630
because of what happened to my mother,

08:27.630 --> 08:28.310
I no longer

08:28.310 --> 08:29.840
hold any hope for marriage.

08:30.430 --> 08:32.000
Even if it's Third Master,

08:32.510 --> 08:33.570
it's no exception.

08:36.150 --> 08:36.840
I...

08:37.600 --> 08:39.460
I thought you liked Third Master.

08:41.390 --> 08:42.720
Liking him doesn't mean

08:42.720 --> 08:43.789
I have to marry him.

08:46.150 --> 08:47.010
Think about it.

08:47.630 --> 08:49.670
I have Grandmother's love now.

08:50.120 --> 08:51.670
My father can't control me.

08:52.000 --> 08:53.360
And I have money.

08:53.750 --> 08:54.720
I should just live

08:54.720 --> 08:55.850
freely and happily.

08:56.440 --> 08:57.700
Why must I get married,

08:58.440 --> 08:59.900
be trapped in a courtyard,

09:00.510 --> 09:01.710
and look for trouble?

09:03.360 --> 09:06.910
[Pavilion of Fragrant Incense]

09:04.440 --> 09:05.310
But...

09:05.510 --> 09:07.180
-But...
-No buts.

09:07.270 --> 09:08.510
No matter how much I like him,

09:08.510 --> 09:10.040
I like myself more, don't I?

09:12.630 --> 09:13.390
Besides,

09:14.510 --> 09:15.270
I have many things

09:15.270 --> 09:16.800
to handle with my business.

09:17.150 --> 09:19.000
The batch of tea leaves I shipped
from Jiangnan

09:19.000 --> 09:20.400
should be arriving soon.

09:20.960 --> 09:21.810
That's the first

09:21.810 --> 09:22.940
shipment to Shanxi.

09:23.290 --> 09:31.040
[Pavilion of Fragrant Incense]

09:23.750 --> 09:24.870
I actually thought

09:24.960 --> 09:26.030
I should go with this batch

09:26.030 --> 09:27.430
and make a trip to Shanxi.

09:29.720 --> 09:31.910
Hearing reports from the managers
is one thing,

09:31.910 --> 09:33.320
but I won't feel settled

09:33.550 --> 09:35.080
unless I go see for myself.

09:39.510 --> 09:40.200
My Lady.

09:55.670 --> 09:56.510
What's this?

09:57.270 --> 09:59.510
When you just reached coming-of-age,

10:00.090 --> 10:00.890
Madam started

10:00.910 --> 10:02.840
embroidering this wedding dress.

10:02.870 --> 10:04.500
She was afraid you might see it

10:04.500 --> 10:05.620
and get upset,

10:06.080 --> 10:08.080
so she always embroidered it in secret.

10:08.080 --> 10:09.150
That morning,

10:09.840 --> 10:11.080
when I saw Madam,

10:13.510 --> 10:15.790
this wedding dress and a letter

10:15.960 --> 10:17.620
were placed right beside her.

10:17.960 --> 10:19.120
Madam left the letter

10:19.120 --> 10:21.650
telling me to put the wedding dress
away first

10:22.120 --> 10:23.440
and give it to you

10:23.750 --> 10:24.880
on your wedding day.

10:26.510 --> 10:28.750
But after hearing what you just said

10:29.000 --> 10:30.200
to Qingpu,

10:31.030 --> 10:32.390
I took the liberty

10:32.960 --> 10:33.630
of thinking

10:34.120 --> 10:35.910
I should give it to you now.

11:00.750 --> 11:02.210
My dear daughter Jinzhao.

11:02.960 --> 11:04.260
Now that I'm leaving,

11:04.510 --> 11:06.790
you are the one I worry about the most.

11:10.440 --> 11:12.150
I'm a useless person.

11:13.550 --> 11:15.910
I have made many mistakes in my life,

11:16.600 --> 11:18.630
among which two are the worst.

11:19.200 --> 11:20.000
One

11:20.360 --> 11:21.840
is marrying your father.

11:23.240 --> 11:24.270
The other

11:24.870 --> 11:26.810
is sending you to Tongzhou,

11:27.320 --> 11:29.320
separating us mother and daughter.

11:30.390 --> 11:31.850
I sewed this wedding dress

11:31.960 --> 11:34.190
for you with my own hands.

11:34.320 --> 11:35.750
My craftsmanship is just passable,

11:35.750 --> 11:37.280
but it is finally finished.

11:38.360 --> 11:39.910
But at this very moment,

11:40.510 --> 11:42.510
I don't even know if leaving it to you

11:42.600 --> 11:44.510
is right or wrong.

11:47.550 --> 11:50.030
See what a muddled person I am?

11:50.240 --> 11:51.600
Muddled my whole life,

11:52.120 --> 11:53.150
now

11:53.150 --> 11:55.810
I don't even have the strength left
for regrets.

11:55.960 --> 11:57.630
Whether you marry or not,

11:57.840 --> 11:59.440
just keep this wedding dress

11:59.840 --> 12:02.080
as a memento.

12:02.600 --> 12:03.790
My dear daughter,

12:04.000 --> 12:05.330
You are smarter than me.

12:05.550 --> 12:07.960
I only have one wish for you.

12:08.320 --> 12:09.120
In all things,

12:09.270 --> 12:11.200
learn from your maternal grandmother.

12:11.200 --> 12:13.440
Be independent wherever you are.

12:14.080 --> 12:15.550
Whatever you are,

12:16.510 --> 12:18.320
don't be like me.

12:53.390 --> 12:54.850
Second Daughter-in-Law.

12:55.750 --> 12:57.550
We cover the deficit every year.

12:57.790 --> 13:00.080
Why does it keep getting bigger?

13:01.440 --> 13:02.200
Mother.

13:03.030 --> 13:05.760
The common fund had little surplus
to begin with.

13:06.360 --> 13:08.270
Our social expenses this year

13:08.520 --> 13:09.640
have increased.

13:12.480 --> 13:14.810
It's my failure as the household manager.

13:16.510 --> 13:17.670
It is not your fault.

13:19.080 --> 13:20.340
For this large family,

13:20.630 --> 13:21.440
there have always been

13:21.440 --> 13:22.970
more expenses than income.

13:26.360 --> 13:27.630
Is Lian's dowry list

13:27.630 --> 13:28.510
ready?

13:30.270 --> 13:32.870
I was just about to discuss with you
about this.

13:33.670 --> 13:36.330
Lavish weddings are popular
in the capital now.

13:36.910 --> 13:38.600
The Yao family has four sons.

13:39.150 --> 13:40.550
Yao Wenxiu is the fourth.

13:41.080 --> 13:43.540
Lian will have three older sisters-in-law.

13:44.440 --> 13:45.770
Among sisters-in-law,

13:45.900 --> 13:47.560
comparisons are inevitable.

13:48.030 --> 13:49.920
If Lian's dowry is small,

13:50.030 --> 13:52.000
I'm afraid she will be bullied.

13:53.510 --> 13:55.370
You don't need to drop hints to me.

13:56.440 --> 13:57.480
Whoever else I might shortchange,

13:57.480 --> 13:58.120
I would never

13:58.120 --> 13:59.450
shortchange your Lian.

14:04.750 --> 14:05.870
It's just that this hole

14:05.870 --> 14:07.270
is simply too big.

14:17.480 --> 14:18.870
I've always heard

14:19.320 --> 14:21.360
that the fourth branch's family estates

14:21.360 --> 14:22.150
have been

14:22.840 --> 14:24.500
doing quite well these years.

14:24.510 --> 14:25.550
The fourth branch's business

14:25.550 --> 14:26.550
has always been managed with the help

14:26.550 --> 14:27.630
of the Ji family.

14:28.200 --> 14:30.000
Since they are good at doing business,

14:30.000 --> 14:32.080
naturally it's doing quite well.

14:35.510 --> 14:36.240
Mother,

14:37.720 --> 14:39.200
what do you mean?

14:43.000 --> 14:44.460
This is what I'm thinking.

14:46.600 --> 14:48.260
The fourth son's wife is gone.

14:48.510 --> 14:49.720
It's inappropriate for a widower like him

14:49.720 --> 14:50.870
to raise children

14:51.150 --> 14:52.120
all by himself.

14:53.790 --> 14:55.150
As his legitimate mother,

14:55.150 --> 14:56.200
I can't just stand by

14:56.200 --> 14:57.320
and do nothing.

14:57.630 --> 14:58.600
If word gets out,

14:58.750 --> 15:00.080
I'll be the one to blame.

15:02.270 --> 15:03.080
Why don't we

15:03.720 --> 15:05.480
have his family

15:05.840 --> 15:06.790
move back here?

15:07.340 --> 15:09.680
[Ji Mansion of Tongzhou]

15:12.600 --> 15:13.270
So?

15:13.600 --> 15:14.670
Did you find out where

15:14.670 --> 15:16.000
Zhao is going this time?

15:16.620 --> 15:17.480
When exactly is she planning

15:17.480 --> 15:18.880
to return to the capital?

15:19.550 --> 15:21.630
She's stayed there for nearly three years.

15:21.630 --> 15:22.750
It's unreasonable.

15:22.750 --> 15:24.320
She isn't planning to return
to the capital.

15:24.320 --> 15:26.480
She says it's for business.

15:26.600 --> 15:27.910
It seems she brought in
a shipload of goods

15:27.910 --> 15:29.000
from Jiangnan.

15:29.510 --> 15:30.960
She went to the depot early in the morning

15:30.960 --> 15:32.960
and didn't come back until just now.

15:33.720 --> 15:35.360
The Old Madam is also too much.

15:35.360 --> 15:36.360
She didn't even

15:36.360 --> 15:37.360
consult me, the lady in charge

15:37.360 --> 15:38.090
of the house.

15:38.390 --> 15:39.750
She just let her mourn here.

15:39.750 --> 15:40.270
Does she really think

15:40.270 --> 15:41.400
this is Zhao's home?

15:41.910 --> 15:42.670
Where is Yao?

15:43.080 --> 15:43.750
He just came back

15:43.750 --> 15:45.510
from checking the shop in Xianghe.

15:45.510 --> 15:47.030
Hearing his cousin arrived,

15:47.030 --> 15:47.670
he immediately went

15:47.670 --> 15:48.670
to her courtyard.

15:49.150 --> 15:50.510
My silly son.

15:51.120 --> 15:52.080
You go there.

15:52.510 --> 15:53.360
Just say...

15:53.720 --> 15:55.200
Just say that I'm not feeling well.

15:55.200 --> 15:56.400
Tell Yao to come back.

15:56.550 --> 15:57.120
Yes.

15:58.000 --> 15:58.670
Forget it.

15:58.870 --> 15:59.730
I'll go myself.

16:08.510 --> 16:10.510
Then start thinking about it today.

16:12.720 --> 16:14.250
I will wait for your answer.

16:28.720 --> 16:29.150
[General Register of Land and Property Deeds
for the Ji Clan's Commercial Firm

16:29.150 --> 16:29.590
in Pingyang Prefecture, Da Yan]

16:34.270 --> 16:35.000
What?

16:35.320 --> 16:36.720
You know everything now?

16:37.720 --> 16:38.840
Explain yourself.

16:39.600 --> 16:40.670
Sneaking around,

16:40.670 --> 16:42.320
buying land in Shanxi

16:42.670 --> 16:43.870
and setting up shops.

16:44.080 --> 16:45.480
What are you trying to do?

16:45.720 --> 16:47.360
I wasn't sneaking around.

16:47.550 --> 16:49.360
If I really wanted to sneak around,

16:49.360 --> 16:51.240
would you have been able to find out?

16:51.240 --> 16:52.670
You think you're right, don't you?

16:52.670 --> 16:53.240
Gu Jinzhao,

16:53.240 --> 16:55.100
what exactly are you trying to do?

16:55.390 --> 16:57.050
I'm not trying to do anything.

16:58.510 --> 17:00.120
I just heard that in Shanxi,

17:00.320 --> 17:02.390
they are relatively tolerant of women
in business.

17:02.390 --> 17:04.250
Maybe I'll go there in the future,

17:04.720 --> 17:06.680
so I'm preparing in advance.

17:09.069 --> 17:10.720
What do you mean by

17:11.240 --> 17:13.000
"relatively tolerant of women"?

17:13.000 --> 17:14.440
How far in the future?

17:15.440 --> 17:17.440
Are you not planning to get married?

17:18.270 --> 17:19.680
I never thought about getting married.

17:19.680 --> 17:20.410
Ridiculous!

17:21.960 --> 17:23.020
What are you doing?

17:23.880 --> 17:25.609
-You scared me!
-You scared me!

17:28.960 --> 17:29.750
I disagree!

17:30.880 --> 17:31.880
Let alone Grandmother,

17:31.880 --> 17:33.110
I'm the first to disagree.

17:33.110 --> 17:34.310
On what grounds do you disagree?

17:34.310 --> 17:35.040
Because I...

17:41.200 --> 17:41.920
I know

17:42.590 --> 17:43.990
you're scared because of

17:44.830 --> 17:46.240
what happened with Aunt.

17:47.440 --> 17:47.840
But...

17:48.070 --> 17:50.000
But it's just like doing business.

17:50.000 --> 17:52.400
Many people lose everything.

17:52.920 --> 17:54.720
But you can't just stop doing it.

17:57.290 --> 17:58.270
You don't understand.

17:58.270 --> 17:59.600
How do I not understand?

18:07.070 --> 18:08.350
If you're afraid,

18:09.240 --> 18:10.670
why not marry me instead?

18:10.920 --> 18:12.350
-I...
-What nonsense are you talking about?

18:12.350 --> 18:13.900
I'm not talking nonsense.

18:14.030 --> 18:15.110
Didn't Grandmother

18:15.110 --> 18:15.790
originally hope

18:15.790 --> 18:17.250
that we would be together?

18:18.070 --> 18:19.110
Do you like me?

18:20.270 --> 18:20.880
I...

18:23.920 --> 18:25.680
I... I'm...

18:26.270 --> 18:28.210
I'm just worried about you.

18:28.410 --> 18:30.510
I'm worried that you'll end up
never marrying.

18:30.510 --> 18:31.640
If you marry me,

18:32.030 --> 18:33.200
I promise you will never be

18:33.200 --> 18:35.260
scared or worried again in your life.

18:36.680 --> 18:38.080
Greetings, First Madam.

18:38.310 --> 18:38.830
Quickly get up.

18:38.830 --> 18:39.560
First Madam!

18:43.350 --> 18:43.750
Mother.

18:43.750 --> 18:45.080
Greetings, First Aunt.

18:45.880 --> 18:47.270
What are you doing

18:47.510 --> 18:49.570
with the door closed so late at night?

18:49.960 --> 18:51.200
We were talking

18:51.720 --> 18:54.310
about investing in the draft bank
in Jiangnan.

18:54.310 --> 18:55.240
It's confidential,

18:55.240 --> 18:56.700
so we had to close the door.

18:57.510 --> 18:58.790
I see.

19:00.160 --> 19:01.030
Your father

19:01.240 --> 19:02.400
asked you to go over.

19:02.640 --> 19:04.700
He has something to talk to you about.

19:06.640 --> 19:07.160
Yes.

19:14.440 --> 19:15.440
Zhao.

19:16.190 --> 19:18.000
The three-year mourning period
is almost over.

19:18.000 --> 19:20.130
When are you returning to the capital?

19:20.920 --> 19:22.650
I haven't thought about it yet.

19:23.030 --> 19:23.680
Why?

19:24.790 --> 19:25.640
First Aunt,

19:25.720 --> 19:27.160
do you not want me to stay?

19:28.720 --> 19:30.070
How could I dare?

19:31.350 --> 19:33.550
Even though you're not one of Ji family,

19:33.960 --> 19:35.960
you're Old Madam's favorite.

19:36.720 --> 19:38.920
I wouldn't dare not let you stay.

19:45.510 --> 19:46.160
My Lady,

19:46.720 --> 19:47.750
why was First Madam

19:47.750 --> 19:49.750
speaking with such a barbed tongue?

19:49.830 --> 19:50.490
Never mind.

19:51.270 --> 19:52.480
For Yao's sake,

19:52.590 --> 19:53.850
I won't argue with her.

19:54.470 --> 20:01.540
[Chen Mansion]

19:54.790 --> 19:56.160
I just sent word to the palace,

19:56.160 --> 19:57.440
saying I'm not feeling well,

19:57.440 --> 19:58.970
and asked for half a day off.

19:59.000 --> 19:59.760
Third Master,

19:59.760 --> 20:00.640
didn't you say you'd let Miss Gu

20:00.640 --> 20:01.270
mourn in peace,

20:01.270 --> 20:02.680
giving her enough time to consider?

20:02.680 --> 20:03.240
Why are you

20:03.240 --> 20:04.500
running after her now?

20:05.160 --> 20:06.070
A few days ago, she

20:06.070 --> 20:07.890
shipped several ships of goods
from Jiangnan,

20:07.890 --> 20:09.750
intending to sell them in Shanxi.

20:10.830 --> 20:11.590
She is a person

20:11.590 --> 20:13.790
who is extremely cautious in business.

20:14.110 --> 20:15.100
I'm worried

20:15.200 --> 20:16.860
she likes to do things herself

20:17.550 --> 20:19.750
and might go to Shanxi with these goods.

20:20.680 --> 20:22.080
That would mean trouble.

20:23.720 --> 20:24.200
I'll go.

20:29.070 --> 20:30.270
Okay, go back.

20:30.490 --> 20:33.880
[Chen Mansion]

20:34.160 --> 20:34.990
[Chen Mansion]

20:35.060 --> 20:39.160
[Ji's Depot]

20:42.070 --> 20:42.720
My Lady.

20:44.830 --> 20:45.490
Uncle Ping.

20:45.550 --> 20:46.830
The horses have been fed.

20:46.830 --> 20:49.270
We can set off after resting
for a quarter of an hour.

20:49.270 --> 20:49.750
Okay.

20:50.720 --> 20:51.380
Uncle Ping,

20:51.510 --> 20:53.030
a powerful outsider can't compete
with a local.

20:53.030 --> 20:54.090
When you get there,

20:54.240 --> 20:56.400
go pay our respects
to the local bosses.

20:56.400 --> 20:57.860
And don't rush to compete.

20:57.880 --> 20:58.920
Whatever price they sell at,

20:58.920 --> 21:00.240
we sell at the same price.

21:00.240 --> 21:02.790
We can even make it five percent
more expensive

21:02.790 --> 21:03.720
than others.

21:04.000 --> 21:05.800
It saves us from making enemies.

21:08.060 --> 21:09.400
When we have established a foothold,

21:09.400 --> 21:11.000
we can think of other things.

21:11.820 --> 21:12.820
Then I

21:12.850 --> 21:14.710
will go check on the other things.

21:18.720 --> 21:19.830
Do it carefully.

21:22.240 --> 21:23.240
Let's go, My Lady.

21:26.750 --> 21:27.310
My Lady,

21:27.880 --> 21:28.940
it's Third Master.

21:40.680 --> 21:41.790
Why is he here?

21:49.680 --> 21:50.480
Third Master.

21:51.270 --> 21:52.000
Gu Jinzhao.

21:53.400 --> 21:54.160
This is the

21:54.160 --> 21:55.890
final answer you're giving me?

21:57.160 --> 21:58.240
Do you really not

21:59.070 --> 22:00.350
want to reconsider it?

22:02.880 --> 22:03.350
I...

22:04.000 --> 22:04.750
I really...

22:05.270 --> 22:07.030
I really shouldn't have indulged you
so much.

22:07.030 --> 22:08.270
You just decide to leave

22:08.270 --> 22:09.930
and head straight for Shanxi.

22:11.820 --> 22:13.480
Who said I was going to Shanxi?

22:13.560 --> 22:14.520
I just wanted

22:14.550 --> 22:15.750
to see Uncle Ping off.

22:18.590 --> 22:19.820
Let me.

22:25.000 --> 22:26.610
You're not going to Shanxi?

22:26.750 --> 22:27.480
Be careful.

22:31.030 --> 22:32.090
If that's the case,

22:32.270 --> 22:34.070
you go ahead with your business.

22:34.240 --> 22:34.880
I...

22:37.240 --> 22:38.440
I'll go drink some tea

22:38.960 --> 22:39.890
and wait for you.

22:44.960 --> 22:45.420
My Lady,

22:45.720 --> 22:46.720
we can depart.

22:47.640 --> 22:48.920
Please be careful.

22:49.640 --> 22:51.070
Take care, My Lady.

22:54.750 --> 22:55.510
Let's go!

23:19.440 --> 23:20.480
This man

23:21.240 --> 23:22.500
seems to have changed.

23:32.950 --> 23:34.390
Are you on leave today?

23:35.510 --> 23:36.110
No.

23:43.000 --> 23:43.960
Then it must be

23:44.510 --> 23:46.310
that things aren't busy at Court

23:46.550 --> 23:48.010
and there's nothing much.

23:55.950 --> 23:58.370
My grandmother went to Baoping.

23:58.400 --> 24:00.920
Yao also returned to the capital today.

24:03.040 --> 24:04.900
My eldest uncle and aunt are here.

24:04.920 --> 24:06.510
How about I ask them out

24:06.640 --> 24:08.370
to talk with you, Third Master?

24:08.880 --> 24:10.870
I haven't even finished a cup of tea,

24:10.870 --> 24:13.130
and you're already trying to kick me out?

24:13.140 --> 24:14.140
No, no.

24:16.640 --> 24:17.510
That's good.

24:17.750 --> 24:19.610
There's no need to see the others.

24:19.790 --> 24:20.510
Today,

24:20.830 --> 24:21.760
I came to see you.

24:36.790 --> 24:37.350
You...

24:38.260 --> 24:39.370
Don't move.

24:39.920 --> 24:41.550
Let's talk properly.

24:44.790 --> 24:45.440
Okay.

24:47.670 --> 24:49.650
Have you seriously considered

24:50.590 --> 24:51.350
what I said to you

24:51.350 --> 24:52.480
at Baoxiang Temple?

24:53.790 --> 24:54.640
Which part?

24:56.230 --> 24:58.560
The part about including me in your plans.

25:00.110 --> 25:01.540
Didn't I tell you

25:01.880 --> 25:03.210
I'm not considering it?

25:05.030 --> 25:06.270
Gu Jinzhao.

25:08.510 --> 25:09.720
Look at you now.

25:09.790 --> 25:11.520
You expect me to talk properly?

25:11.540 --> 25:13.200
Go back to the capital with me.

25:15.270 --> 25:17.070
Maybe if you stay under my nose,

25:17.400 --> 25:19.260
you'll be able to think properly.

25:19.550 --> 25:19.960
You...

25:21.590 --> 25:22.000
Hey!

25:22.750 --> 25:24.640
You're throwing your weight around!

25:24.640 --> 25:26.120
Once in a while is fine.

25:27.270 --> 25:28.510
Anyway, the Ji family

25:28.510 --> 25:30.160
hasn't settled accounts with me
for a long time.

25:30.160 --> 25:31.070
Who says so?

25:31.350 --> 25:32.750
They've been submitted properly.

25:32.750 --> 25:34.750
They were handled by subordinates.

25:34.830 --> 25:36.760
Who knows if there were omissions?

25:37.510 --> 25:38.070
I should

25:38.680 --> 25:40.080
personally go over them.

25:47.440 --> 25:47.880
My Lady.

25:47.880 --> 25:48.550
Ms. Zhao.

25:49.480 --> 25:50.940
How is the investigation?

25:55.200 --> 25:56.590
Third Master is not an outsider.

25:56.590 --> 25:57.790
You can speak freely.

25:59.110 --> 25:59.720
Yes.

26:00.270 --> 26:01.800
As you instructed, My Lady,

26:01.830 --> 26:02.510
I went through Madam's

26:02.510 --> 26:04.110
belongings she brought to the Gu family

26:04.110 --> 26:05.030
item by item.

26:05.110 --> 26:06.510
And in a box,

26:06.640 --> 26:07.510
I found this.

26:14.480 --> 26:15.350
An IOU.

26:16.570 --> 26:18.250
[IOU]

26:18.070 --> 26:19.590
20,000 taels of silver.

26:18.290 --> 26:20.070
[Issuer: Mrs. Gu-Feng]
[Witness: Gu Deyuan]

26:20.750 --> 26:21.830
Who is this

26:22.030 --> 26:22.960
Mrs. Gu-Feng?

26:23.310 --> 26:24.720
It's the Old Madam of the Gu family.

26:24.720 --> 26:26.110
Seeing this IOU

26:26.110 --> 26:27.570
reminded me of something.

26:27.640 --> 26:29.610
When Madam first married Master,

26:29.750 --> 26:31.610
she went to the Daxin ancestral home.

26:31.610 --> 26:33.750
One day, Old Madam Gu came forward

26:33.980 --> 26:37.040
and wanted to borrow 20,000 taels of silver
from Madam.

26:37.140 --> 26:38.160
Madam was too polite to refuse,

26:38.160 --> 26:38.960
so she agreed.

26:39.510 --> 26:40.640
Who would have thought that

26:40.640 --> 26:41.790
it's been 20 years,

26:42.350 --> 26:44.150
and it still hasn't been repaid.

26:44.510 --> 26:45.790
If Mother didn't push,

26:46.240 --> 26:48.700
others naturally wouldn't
rush to repay it.

26:50.200 --> 26:52.000
Did my paternal grandmother say

26:52.790 --> 26:55.120
what she was going to do
with so much money?

26:55.510 --> 26:56.910
I really don't know that.

26:57.200 --> 26:58.870
Among the wealthy families in the capital,

26:58.870 --> 27:00.530
none of them don't lack money.

27:00.590 --> 27:02.160
Families like your fourth branch,

27:02.160 --> 27:03.220
who manage so well,

27:03.270 --> 27:04.480
are extremely rare.

27:04.750 --> 27:07.000
Oh, I almost forgot to tell you something.

27:07.000 --> 27:08.260
Yesterday your father

27:08.440 --> 27:09.840
took your younger sister

27:10.200 --> 27:11.530
and moved back to Daxin.

27:13.240 --> 27:14.070
Is he

27:14.270 --> 27:16.000
merging back into the ancestral home?

27:16.000 --> 27:16.920
I suppose so.

27:17.440 --> 27:18.070
Your father

27:18.070 --> 27:19.870
is a widower raising a daughter,

27:20.350 --> 27:22.280
so it's proper for him to move back.

27:22.410 --> 27:23.940
As for your ancestral home,

27:25.350 --> 27:26.640
isn't your cousin

27:27.160 --> 27:28.640
getting engaged to the son of

27:28.640 --> 27:29.510
Yao Ping, Vice Minister of Justice?

27:29.510 --> 27:30.590
Nowadays in the capital,

27:30.590 --> 27:32.030
lavish weddings are popular.

27:32.030 --> 27:32.960
It's even more difficult for a woman

27:32.960 --> 27:33.920
marrying into a higher status.

27:33.920 --> 27:35.680
They're probably strapped for cash

27:35.680 --> 27:36.880
regarding the dowry.

27:38.590 --> 27:39.480
So they've set their eyes

27:39.480 --> 27:41.140
on our fourth branch's money.

27:41.720 --> 27:43.450
What a brilliant calculation.

27:45.110 --> 27:46.240
Unfortunately for them,

27:46.240 --> 27:47.840
they're dealing with me now.

27:47.960 --> 27:49.720
They want to move back
to the ancestral home, right?

27:49.720 --> 27:51.650
Then we'll all move back together.

28:00.240 --> 28:03.300
This time, I'm not the one
throwing my weight around.

28:06.770 --> 28:10.150
[Balanced as stars on a tripod]

28:08.640 --> 28:10.400
I heard Third Master came over.

28:10.960 --> 28:12.550
I rushed back immediately,

28:12.830 --> 28:14.950
but still didn't make it in time.

28:16.410 --> 28:17.740
He came here on business

28:17.790 --> 28:18.920
and went back today.

28:19.110 --> 28:21.070
He said he has to be on duty tonight.

28:23.400 --> 28:24.240
Somebody!

28:26.590 --> 28:28.220
Take this plate of
Three-Shred Steamed Dumplings

28:28.220 --> 28:29.290
to the clan school

28:29.720 --> 28:30.640
for Rong.

28:30.790 --> 28:32.070
He studies hard.

28:32.270 --> 28:33.510
He gets hungry easily at night.

28:33.510 --> 28:34.070
Yes.

28:38.070 --> 28:39.270
First Madam is here.

28:42.070 --> 28:43.160
Mother.

28:46.350 --> 28:47.700
Second Madam Xu has left?

28:47.700 --> 28:49.560
Yes, she has left.

28:51.310 --> 28:52.240
Eat more.

28:53.440 --> 28:55.240
You are busy with business every day,

28:55.240 --> 28:56.440
and have lost weight.

28:56.640 --> 28:57.720
I haven't lost weight.

28:57.720 --> 28:58.920
I'm just getting taller.

28:58.920 --> 29:00.070
Really?

29:00.400 --> 29:02.060
You're growing taller again?

29:03.230 --> 29:05.480
I'll tell the kitchen later

29:05.480 --> 29:06.640
to make some soup for you

29:06.640 --> 29:07.970
to build up your health.

29:15.330 --> 29:16.810
Look how happy you are.

29:17.310 --> 29:18.920
Did something good happen?

29:20.310 --> 29:21.960
You noticed it, didn't you?

29:22.720 --> 29:23.690
Do you know

29:23.750 --> 29:25.160
why Second Madam Xu came to see me

29:25.160 --> 29:26.310
today?

29:27.000 --> 29:28.350
Why?

29:28.720 --> 29:30.830
She came to be a matchmaker for Yao.

29:31.200 --> 29:32.240
Really?

29:33.440 --> 29:34.830
Which family?

29:35.200 --> 29:37.790
The eldest daughter of the Li family
at the East Gate.

29:37.790 --> 29:39.290
That family.

29:39.680 --> 29:41.200
They're average.

29:43.510 --> 29:45.110
I think so too.

29:45.640 --> 29:47.400
But Second Madam Xu said

29:48.000 --> 29:49.350
that although the Li family's business

29:49.350 --> 29:51.070
is not as good as ours,

29:51.400 --> 29:53.420
they have a thriving

29:53.830 --> 29:55.310
and harmonious family.

29:56.350 --> 29:58.210
The biological mother of Miss Li,

29:58.240 --> 29:59.390
the Third Madam,

29:59.680 --> 30:01.580
is truly a woman of great fortune.

30:02.160 --> 30:03.770
Besides having Miss Li,

30:03.860 --> 30:05.520
she even had twins

30:05.920 --> 30:07.520
at thirty-seven.

30:09.440 --> 30:11.440
Now, nearing forty,

30:12.110 --> 30:15.030
both her parents are still alive.

30:15.750 --> 30:16.550
Tell me,

30:17.160 --> 30:19.120
isn't she extremely blessed?

30:19.240 --> 30:20.400
I was thinking,

30:20.640 --> 30:23.500
Yao doesn't have any siblings.

30:24.830 --> 30:26.720
Did you say that for my benefit?

30:26.790 --> 30:28.700
Mother, you misunderstood.

30:28.880 --> 30:30.680
That's not what I meant.

30:30.830 --> 30:31.680
I...

30:32.160 --> 30:34.170
I only have Yao as my son.

30:34.510 --> 30:35.510
Naturally, I hope

30:35.550 --> 30:36.640
he can marry a

30:37.070 --> 30:38.920
blessed girl.

30:41.640 --> 30:42.510
Aunt.

30:43.400 --> 30:44.830
What do you mean by that?

30:45.480 --> 30:46.440
I know.

30:47.240 --> 30:48.570
Aren't you just worried

30:48.750 --> 30:49.440
that Grandmother

30:49.440 --> 30:50.750
will betroth me to Yao?

30:53.000 --> 30:54.860
I didn't want to marry him either.

30:55.310 --> 30:56.110
But if you keep

30:56.130 --> 30:57.590
bringing up my late mother

30:57.590 --> 30:58.400
to target me,

30:59.270 --> 31:00.550
then I might just change my mind.

31:00.550 --> 31:01.030
You...

31:01.160 --> 31:02.440
My fate is poor to begin with.

31:02.440 --> 31:04.110
It would be perfect to borrow

31:04.510 --> 31:05.750
some blessings from Yao.

31:05.750 --> 31:06.240
You!

31:08.000 --> 31:09.030
Mother.

31:09.060 --> 31:09.590
Get out.

31:10.750 --> 31:11.510
Get out!

31:23.130 --> 31:30.110
[Glowing Bloom]

31:23.680 --> 31:24.640
Grandmother.

31:25.750 --> 31:26.790
I plan

31:27.880 --> 31:29.940
to go back to the capital in a few days.

31:31.680 --> 31:33.610
Are you going back to the Gu family?

31:34.740 --> 31:36.540
Don't mind

31:36.570 --> 31:38.520
what your aunt said.

31:39.110 --> 31:40.110
In this house,

31:40.440 --> 31:42.380
she is not the one in charge.

31:42.640 --> 31:44.030
Not back to Sili Hutong,

31:44.550 --> 31:45.440
but to

31:45.750 --> 31:47.210
the Daxin ancestral home.

31:49.440 --> 31:50.510
What's going on?

31:51.160 --> 31:52.440
I heard my father

31:52.440 --> 31:55.500
is moving the fourth branch
back to the ancestral home.

31:55.830 --> 31:56.720
Although

31:56.750 --> 31:58.240
I haven't figured out

31:58.550 --> 31:59.950
what the exact reason is,

32:00.720 --> 32:01.640
I assume

32:01.790 --> 32:03.790
it won't be a harmonious situation.

32:04.000 --> 32:04.830
You girl.

32:05.400 --> 32:06.730
You have a sharp tongue.

32:07.160 --> 32:08.290
Please listen to me.

32:08.440 --> 32:09.160
Ms. Zhao

32:09.160 --> 32:10.510
went through my mother's belongings

32:10.510 --> 32:11.750
and found an IOU.

32:12.030 --> 32:12.880
An IOU?

32:13.830 --> 32:15.090
It's from 20 years ago,

32:15.270 --> 32:16.880
for a full 20,000 taels of silver.

32:16.880 --> 32:18.110
It was actually my paternal grandmother

32:18.110 --> 32:20.370
who borrowed it directly from my mother.

32:21.400 --> 32:22.160
Take a look.

32:22.770 --> 32:27.780
[IOU]

32:28.440 --> 32:29.960
When your mother was alive,

32:29.960 --> 32:31.110
she never mentioned

32:31.110 --> 32:32.640
this to me.

32:35.960 --> 32:37.400
Do you want to go back

32:38.070 --> 32:39.920
and get this money back?

32:40.440 --> 32:41.440
Of course I do.

32:41.750 --> 32:43.080
20,000 taels of silver,

32:43.160 --> 32:44.880
with twenty years of compound interest,

32:44.880 --> 32:46.140
how much would that be?

32:49.640 --> 32:51.030
You should get it back.

32:52.550 --> 32:53.960
Not just the debt.

32:55.160 --> 32:56.790
When your mother married into the family,

32:56.790 --> 32:58.110
they hadn't split the household yet.

32:58.110 --> 33:00.510
The dowry all went to Daxin.

33:01.590 --> 33:04.070
Later, when we divided the property
and checked the inventory,

33:04.070 --> 33:05.680
many things were missing.

33:07.030 --> 33:08.030
There was a set

33:08.350 --> 33:10.010
of yellow rosewood furniture

33:10.790 --> 33:12.650
that they actually replaced with

33:12.680 --> 33:13.750
boxwood ones.

33:15.400 --> 33:17.030
Your poor mother was useless.

33:17.030 --> 33:19.560
She just swallowed her anger
and accepted it.

33:21.200 --> 33:23.160
Since you are going to Daxin this time,

33:23.160 --> 33:24.440
you might as well

33:24.510 --> 33:25.750
ask for it all back.

33:29.110 --> 33:30.580
So,

33:30.880 --> 33:32.350
you agree to let me go back?

33:35.830 --> 33:37.950
You are a child with your own ideas.

33:38.750 --> 33:40.000
You know what should be done

33:40.000 --> 33:41.310
and what shouldn't.

33:42.000 --> 33:44.270
You've always had good judgment.

33:45.880 --> 33:48.310
Although I hate to see you go,

33:49.070 --> 33:50.350
I also know that

33:51.240 --> 33:52.720
a child kept tied to the apron strings

33:52.720 --> 33:54.450
will never achieve greatness.

33:54.960 --> 33:55.890
If you want to go,

33:56.240 --> 33:57.400
then go.

33:59.000 --> 34:01.030
But you must remember one thing.

34:01.480 --> 34:02.960
My home

34:03.070 --> 34:04.470
is your home.

34:04.550 --> 34:05.510
Whenever

34:05.510 --> 34:07.570
you want to come back, just come back.

34:07.720 --> 34:08.550
Got it?

34:10.840 --> 34:11.710
Got it.

34:13.960 --> 34:15.260
Grandmother,

34:15.400 --> 34:17.530
you are the one I hate to leave the most.

34:19.000 --> 34:21.590
I hate to part with you too.

34:24.760 --> 34:25.400
Thank you.

34:31.670 --> 34:32.469
Young Master.

34:32.550 --> 34:33.630
The old gatekeeper said

34:33.630 --> 34:35.110
the Gu family's fourth branch has returned
to their ancestral home.

34:35.110 --> 34:35.710
A few days ago,

34:35.710 --> 34:37.510
the whole branch moved to Daxin.

34:37.880 --> 34:39.139
What about Gu Jinzhao?

34:39.480 --> 34:42.280
He said she arrived in the capital
yesterday.

34:42.590 --> 34:43.590
She came back here first,

34:43.590 --> 34:44.590
packed some things,

34:44.590 --> 34:46.719
and left for Daxin early this morning.

34:48.000 --> 34:49.239
How heartless of her.

34:49.320 --> 34:50.070
She moved without even

34:50.070 --> 34:50.880
telling me.

34:55.440 --> 34:56.900
Greetings, Grandmother.

35:00.480 --> 35:01.140
Have a seat.

35:03.000 --> 35:04.400
Thank you, Grandmother.

35:06.760 --> 35:07.920
Why didn't you bring Rong

35:07.920 --> 35:08.920
back with you?

35:10.070 --> 35:12.820
The Ji family are outsiders after all,

35:13.030 --> 35:14.360
and they are merchants.

35:14.870 --> 35:15.540
Rong

35:15.630 --> 35:17.440
is the only heir of your fourth branch.

35:17.440 --> 35:19.880
He'll have to take the imperial
examination sooner or later.

35:19.880 --> 35:21.190
He can't hang around with a bunch of

35:21.190 --> 35:22.920
merchants all day long.

35:23.190 --> 35:24.510
He still needs to come back.

35:24.510 --> 35:26.630
Focusing on his studies
is the right thing to do.

35:26.630 --> 35:29.150
I think so too.

35:31.760 --> 35:32.560
Grandmother.

35:33.000 --> 35:35.130
Although the Ji family are merchants,

35:35.280 --> 35:36.460
their family school

35:36.490 --> 35:38.210
is famous even in the capital.

35:39.070 --> 35:40.280
Even Mr. Chen Xuanqing

35:40.280 --> 35:42.340
once studied at the Ji family.

35:42.800 --> 35:44.400
Why can't Rong go there?

35:45.880 --> 35:46.620
Besides,

35:46.710 --> 35:47.400
Rong

35:47.400 --> 35:48.710
did return to the capital.

35:48.710 --> 35:49.690
He just went straight

35:49.690 --> 35:51.350
to the Qifang Hutong Academy.

35:52.570 --> 35:54.400
So Rong is back?

35:54.840 --> 35:55.960
Then why didn't he think of

35:55.960 --> 35:57.160
coming to see us first?

35:57.160 --> 35:58.290
Whose idea was this?

35:58.960 --> 36:00.110
Grandmother,

36:00.230 --> 36:01.440
it was my idea.

36:01.670 --> 36:02.630
Your idea?

36:05.840 --> 36:07.770
Without a mistress in the family,

36:07.840 --> 36:09.620
you really lack manners.

36:10.670 --> 36:11.280
Dezhao.

36:12.360 --> 36:13.440
Lan and Zhao

36:13.440 --> 36:14.500
have both grown up.

36:14.510 --> 36:15.070
Later, I will

36:15.070 --> 36:16.930
call the nannies from my room over

36:17.150 --> 36:18.490
to properly teach them

36:18.590 --> 36:19.760
manners and rules.

36:21.230 --> 36:23.400
So they won't embarrass themselves
when it's time

36:23.400 --> 36:24.660
to arrange marriages.

36:24.670 --> 36:25.470
Grandmother.

36:25.760 --> 36:27.800
Lan and I just finished
our mourning period.

36:27.800 --> 36:29.660
Why the rush to discuss marriage?

36:30.320 --> 36:31.440
Is this the lesson of manners and rules

36:31.440 --> 36:33.000
of our ancestral home?

36:34.070 --> 36:36.000
Then perhaps we'd better not learn.

36:36.000 --> 36:36.760
Zhao.

36:41.440 --> 36:42.320
Mother.

36:42.960 --> 36:45.510
Zhao just returned home.

36:45.710 --> 36:47.480
If she's ignorant about anything,

36:47.480 --> 36:49.670
we can discipline her later.

36:51.840 --> 36:52.670
Zhao.

36:53.150 --> 36:54.630
I heard your father say

36:54.880 --> 36:56.480
that you are now managing the accounts

36:56.480 --> 36:58.480
of the fourth branch's common fund.

36:59.230 --> 36:59.960
Ms. Zhao.

37:08.000 --> 37:10.130
All the common fund accounts are here.

37:10.510 --> 37:11.960
However, because my mother

37:10.700 --> 37:12.310
[General Account of Household Expenses
for Gu Mansion, Director of the Treasury]

37:11.960 --> 37:13.000
has been bedridden for years,

37:13.000 --> 37:14.200
they were neglected.

37:14.920 --> 37:15.880
And my father

37:15.920 --> 37:17.760
has been fully focused on his career.

37:17.760 --> 37:19.290
So there isn't much profit.

37:19.320 --> 37:21.250
I hope you won't mind, Second Aunt.

37:21.590 --> 37:23.230
Not at all.

37:28.630 --> 37:29.990
Old Madam, Madam.

37:30.070 --> 37:31.400
Young Master Ye is here.

37:31.630 --> 37:32.830
What is he doing here?

37:34.630 --> 37:35.820
Did he state his purpose?

37:35.820 --> 37:36.710
No, he didn't.

37:37.630 --> 37:38.440
You may leave.

37:38.590 --> 37:39.110
Yes.

37:42.550 --> 37:44.080
Why is he here?

37:44.920 --> 37:46.070
Could it be that our family

37:46.070 --> 37:48.000
is in some kind of trouble, Mother?

37:48.000 --> 37:49.200
Don't talk nonsense.

37:49.800 --> 37:50.960
If anything happened,

37:50.960 --> 37:52.920
your Fifth Aunt would let us know.

37:54.320 --> 37:55.120
What's wrong?

37:55.760 --> 37:58.020
Young Master Ye doesn't come here often?

37:58.710 --> 37:59.550
Zhao,

37:59.880 --> 38:01.070
you have no idea.

38:01.440 --> 38:02.840
Young Master Ye

38:02.860 --> 38:04.780
has now joined the Penal Court.

38:05.150 --> 38:06.280
He's spending his days

38:06.280 --> 38:08.510
confiscating property
and executing people.

38:08.510 --> 38:10.070
We are all afraid to see him.

38:10.510 --> 38:11.710
Even your Second Uncle

38:11.710 --> 38:13.150
shudders when he sees him.

38:13.150 --> 38:13.840
Your Grandmother has already

38:13.840 --> 38:15.280
instructed your Fifth Aunt

38:15.280 --> 38:17.480
to ask him not to come around for a while.

38:18.550 --> 38:19.320
Mother,

38:19.670 --> 38:21.190
he is an heir after all.

38:21.710 --> 38:22.510
How about

38:23.030 --> 38:24.710
we go out and greet him?

38:26.880 --> 38:27.670
Greet him?

38:28.840 --> 38:29.920
He's a junior.

38:30.360 --> 38:32.030
Does he expect me to bow to him?

38:33.360 --> 38:33.880
Ms. Su.

38:34.000 --> 38:34.550
Yes.

38:35.110 --> 38:35.710
You go

38:36.110 --> 38:37.840
tell him to go to his sister's room.

38:37.840 --> 38:38.920
No need to come here.

38:38.920 --> 38:39.850
No need for what?

38:45.190 --> 38:47.230
Greetings, Your Highness.

38:48.240 --> 38:49.640
Old Madam, please get up.

38:50.000 --> 38:51.230
I am just a junior.

38:51.710 --> 38:53.510
I wouldn't dare accept your bow.

38:54.510 --> 38:56.340
Your Highness, you're joking.

38:56.510 --> 38:57.360
Bowing to you

38:57.840 --> 38:59.150
is what I should do.

39:12.150 --> 39:13.150
I'm here for you.

39:13.590 --> 39:14.230
Come out.

39:14.800 --> 39:16.460
I have something to say to you.

39:35.230 --> 39:35.840
Ye Xian.

39:45.440 --> 39:45.920
Well...

39:46.510 --> 39:48.370
Do you also think I'm terrifying?

39:49.000 --> 39:49.760
Since when did your hearing

39:49.760 --> 39:50.840
get so good?

39:51.230 --> 39:52.510
We were talking behind your back,

39:52.510 --> 39:53.640
and you heard it all?

39:54.880 --> 39:56.630
The Penal Court collects intelligence

39:56.630 --> 39:58.030
and monitors officials.

39:58.070 --> 39:59.710
Eavesdropping on people

40:00.070 --> 40:01.600
is exactly our line of work.

40:02.760 --> 40:03.710
Really?

40:05.630 --> 40:06.320
No.

40:06.760 --> 40:07.360
I held a blade

40:07.360 --> 40:08.820
against that girl's neck.

40:08.960 --> 40:11.190
Naturally, she didn't dare make a sound,

40:11.190 --> 40:12.440
letting me stand outside the door

40:12.440 --> 40:13.360
and listen

40:13.630 --> 40:14.690
as much as I wanted.

40:15.670 --> 40:17.130
Why did you have to do that?

40:20.030 --> 40:21.490
Can you say something new?

40:21.710 --> 40:22.600
"Why do that?"

40:22.620 --> 40:23.400
"Why bother?"

40:23.400 --> 40:24.320
"Why is that?"

40:25.110 --> 40:27.110
Ever since I joined the Penal Court,

40:27.440 --> 40:29.840
I've gotten sick of hearing these phrases.

40:31.550 --> 40:32.360
Okay.

40:32.550 --> 40:33.750
I won't say anything.

40:36.510 --> 40:37.240
What is this?

40:40.760 --> 40:42.280
I just caught two wanted criminals

40:42.280 --> 40:43.610
and got some blood on me.

40:45.110 --> 40:45.670
Well...

40:46.920 --> 40:48.050
Does it disgust you?

40:48.920 --> 40:49.480
Alright.

40:49.880 --> 40:50.840
Go to the guest courtyard

40:50.840 --> 40:52.370
and change out of your robe.

40:53.440 --> 40:54.900
Ye Xian, stop right there.

40:57.030 --> 40:59.490
Do you believe
I'll never speak to you again?

41:11.510 --> 41:12.190
Alright.

41:13.400 --> 41:14.000
I know you...

41:14.000 --> 41:15.000
You know nothing!

41:18.190 --> 41:19.990
Why do you have to take this path?

41:23.590 --> 41:24.920
Because I need power,

41:26.070 --> 41:26.920
and people.

41:29.440 --> 41:30.110
Then can't you...?

41:30.110 --> 41:30.770
No, I can't.

41:31.550 --> 41:32.810
I've thought about it.

41:33.320 --> 41:34.580
There is no other path.

41:35.440 --> 41:36.630
It's the only way

41:36.630 --> 41:37.840
to save my family.

41:49.150 --> 41:50.030
What's this?

41:50.670 --> 41:51.590
It's a bracelet

41:53.150 --> 41:54.800
confiscated from a seized property.

41:54.800 --> 41:56.320
It's already been accounted for.

41:56.320 --> 41:57.980
You can wear it without worry.

42:00.710 --> 42:02.360
-This...
-Throw it away

42:02.760 --> 42:04.220
if you think it's tainted.

42:31.190 --> 42:35.710
[Eternal Glory]

43:10.730 --> 43:11.550
I'm sorry, Lian.

43:11.550 --> 43:12.630
It hurts so much.

43:14.190 --> 43:16.050
I'm... I'm sorry.

43:18.920 --> 43:20.120
Let me prick you once,

43:20.230 --> 43:21.430
and I'll forgive you.

43:22.550 --> 43:23.480
Lian,

43:23.960 --> 43:25.150
I didn't mean it.

43:26.030 --> 43:26.760
You didn't mean it,

43:26.760 --> 43:28.160
but you still pricked me!

43:28.360 --> 43:28.920
What?

43:29.630 --> 43:30.990
If you won't let me,

43:31.020 --> 43:32.640
I'll go tell Grandmother

43:32.840 --> 43:34.400
and let her decide.

43:34.590 --> 43:35.960
Aren't you still hoping

43:35.980 --> 43:37.110
that I'll help you ask Grandmother

43:37.110 --> 43:38.360
for a good marriage?

43:38.550 --> 43:40.010
Don't even think about it.

43:47.880 --> 43:48.480
Wait!

43:51.440 --> 43:52.840
Why should you prick her?

43:54.010 --> 43:55.830
You tripped her on purpose.

43:56.070 --> 43:57.760
She accidentally bumped into you,

43:57.760 --> 43:59.040
so you deserve it.

44:00.190 --> 44:01.230
So what?

44:01.250 --> 44:02.550
I'm the one hurt right now,

44:02.550 --> 44:04.190
and I'm going to prick her back.

44:04.190 --> 44:04.760
So...

44:05.280 --> 44:06.680
Are you going to help her?

44:06.840 --> 44:07.320
Fine.

44:07.840 --> 44:09.400
Then I can prick you instead.

44:09.400 --> 44:10.130
How dare you!

44:11.690 --> 44:12.920
Grandmother keeps talking about

44:12.920 --> 44:14.000
manners and rules.

44:14.590 --> 44:15.590
I thought the rules of this family

44:15.590 --> 44:16.720
would be so great.

44:17.760 --> 44:18.480
It seems

44:18.760 --> 44:20.220
they are nothing special.

44:21.880 --> 44:23.620
Don't try to provoke me.

44:23.650 --> 44:25.160
I won't fall for it.

44:25.800 --> 44:26.400
Is that so?

44:28.590 --> 44:29.630
I heard you just had your
preliminary betrothal

44:29.630 --> 44:30.760
with the Yao family.

44:31.030 --> 44:32.440
The Yao family is a Vice Minister's
household,

44:32.440 --> 44:33.920
a family of poetry and propriety.

44:33.920 --> 44:35.540
If they knew their future daughter-in-law

44:35.540 --> 44:36.940
was so unreasonable

44:37.110 --> 44:38.910
and disregarded sibling bonds,

44:39.030 --> 44:40.550
I wonder if they would

44:40.550 --> 44:41.920
regret this marriage.

44:43.840 --> 44:45.710
You are really out of line, aren't you?

44:45.710 --> 44:46.510
Stop!

44:48.960 --> 44:49.630
Lian.

44:49.840 --> 44:50.440
Grandmother.

44:50.440 --> 44:51.590
Zhao is right.

44:53.560 --> 44:54.810
Grandmother.

44:54.840 --> 44:56.550
Since Zhao is so reasonable,

44:57.280 --> 44:58.230
come and serve

44:58.230 --> 44:59.490
your old grandmother.

44:59.590 --> 45:00.840
Massage my legs.

45:11.000 --> 45:11.800
Grandmother,

45:12.880 --> 45:14.080
is the pressure okay?

45:19.590 --> 45:20.440
Comfortable?

45:23.070 --> 45:24.890
While you are comfortable,

45:25.150 --> 45:27.080
let me discuss something with you.

45:28.840 --> 45:29.590
What is it?

45:31.670 --> 45:33.040
Twenty years ago,

45:33.230 --> 45:34.280
my mother lent you

45:34.280 --> 45:35.610
20,000 taels of silver.

45:37.070 --> 45:38.730
When do you plan to pay it back?

45:41.230 --> 45:42.830
What 20,000 taels of silver?

45:43.840 --> 45:45.900
What nonsense are you talking about?

45:59.920 --> 46:03.600
[A Splendid Match]
